Chapter: BrowserTierDecodeTest
  cites Browser chapter BrowserPersist
  cites Browser chapter TrustManager
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 SignatureSlippage part E: a persisted trust record whose tier is not one of
 the five written decodes to the least privileged tier, never the most.

Section: Helpers
  btd-tier : Text -> Text
  btd-tier (line) = when parse-trust-decision line
    is None -> "refused"
    is Just (d) -> tier-name (d.td-max-tier)

Section: Body
  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni ("tier 3: " & btd-tier "aabb|3|1|-1")
    print-line-uni ("tier 4: " & btd-tier "aabb|4|1|-1")
    print-line-uni ("tier 7: " & btd-tier "aabb|7|1|-1")
    print-line-uni ("tier -1: " & btd-tier "aabb|-1|1|-1")
    print-line-uni ("tier x: " & btd-tier "aabb|x|1|-1")
  end
